---
// Viewport Digital LLC - Christopher Nolan Cinematic Build
// Stack: Astro, Vercel
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Viewport Digital LLC — Cinematic Web Infrastructure & Media</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				color-scheme: dark;
			}
			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
			}
			body {
				margin: 0;
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
				background-color: #030508;
				color: #e2e8f0;
				line-height: 1.5;
				overflow-x: hidden;
				-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
			}

			/* Cinematic Blueprint Grid Lines */
			body::before {
				content: "";
				position: fixed;
				top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
				background-image: 
					linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
					linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
				background-size: 80px 80px;
				pointer-events: none;
				z-index: 1;
			}

			header {
				position: sticky;
				top: 0;
				z-index: 100;
				backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
				background-color: rgba(3, 5, 8, 0.85);
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
			}
			.container {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0 32px;
				position: relative;
				z-index: 2;
			}
			.header-content {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				height: 80px;
			}
			.logo {
				font-weight: 800;
				font-size: 1rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
			}
			.logo span {
				color: #64748b;
				font-weight: 400;
			}
			nav {
				display: flex;
				gap: 36px;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				font-weight: 500;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
				color: #94a3b8;
			}
			nav a {
				color: #94a3b8;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: color 0.2s ease;
			}
			nav a:hover { color: #fff; }
			
			.btn-cinematic {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				padding: 12px 28px;
				background-color: #fff;
				color: #030508;
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
				position: relative;
			}
			.btn-cinematic:hover {
				background-color: #cbd5e1;
				transform: translateY(-2px);
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
			}

			.btn-outline {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				padding: 12px 28px;
				background-color: transparent;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
				color: #fff;
				font-weight: 600;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}
			.btn-outline:hover {
				border-color: #fff;
				background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
			}

			/* Hero Section */
			.hero {
				padding: 160px 0 140px 0;
				position: relative;
			}
			.hero-horizon {
				position: absolute;
				top: 40%;
				left: 50%;
				transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
				width: 700px;
				height: 350px;
				background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08) 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.03) 50%, transparent 70%);
				filter: blur(80px);
				pointer-events: none;
			}
			.hero-tag {
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.2em;
				color: #38bdf8;
				margin-bottom: 24px;
				display: block;
			}
			h1 {
				font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
				font-weight: 800;
				letter-spacing: -0.04em;
				line-height: 0.95;
				color: #fff;
				margin: 0 0 32px 0;
				text-transform: uppercase;
			}
			.hero-p {
				max-width: 600px;
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				color: #94a3b8;
				line-height: 1.6;
				margin-bottom: 48px;
			}
			.hero-actions {
				display: flex;
				gap: 20px;
				align-items: center;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}

			/* Sections */
			section {
				padding: 140px 0;
				border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				position: relative;
				z-index: 2;
			}
			.section-header {
				max-width: 700px;
				margin-bottom: 80px;
			}
			.section-header h2 {
				font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
				font-weight: 800;
				letter-spacing: -0.03em;
				color: #fff;
				margin: 0 0 16px 0;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				line-height: 1.05;
			}
			.section-header p {
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			/* Monumental Flagship Card */
			.monument-card {
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9) 0%, rgba(3, 5, 8, 0.95) 100%);
				border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
				box-shadow: 0 20px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
				padding: 64px;
				position: relative;
				overflow: hidden;
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				gap: 48px;
			}
			@media(min-width: 900px) {
				.monument-card { grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr; align-items: center; }
			}
			.monument-card::after {
				content: "";
				position: absolute;
				top: 0; right: 0; width: 150px; height: 150px;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
				pointer-events: none;
			}
			.price-display {
				font-size: 3rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				color: #fff;
				letter-spacing: -0.03em;
				margin: 16px 0 24px 0;
			}
			.specs-grid {
				list-style: none;
				padding: 0;
				margin: 0 0 40px 0;
				display: grid;
				gap: 16px;
			}
			.specs-grid li {
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				color: #cbd5e1;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 12px;
				border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
				padding-bottom: 12px;
			}
			.specs-grid li::before {
				content: "◆";
				color: #38bdf8;
				font-size: 0.75rem;
			}

			/* Grid Two */
			.grid-2 {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				gap: 32px;
			}
			@media(min-width: 768px) {
				.grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
			}
			.cinematic-box {
				background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
				padding: 48px;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				justify-content: space-between;
				transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
			}
			.cinematic-box:hover { border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); }

			/* Form Terminal */
			.terminal-wrap {
				max-width: 680px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				background: #090d16;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
				box-shadow: 0 30px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
				padding: 56px;
			}
			.form-group {
				margin-bottom: 28px;
			}
			label {
				display: block;
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.15em;
				color: #38bdf8;
				margin-bottom: 10px;
			}
			input, textarea {
				width: 100%;
				padding: 16px;
				background-color: #030508;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
				color: #fff;
				font-size: 1rem;
				box-sizing: border-box;
				outline: none;
				transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
			}
			input:focus, textarea:focus { border-color: #38bdf8; }

			footer {
				padding: 80px 0;
				border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				text-align: center;
				color: #64748b;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				position: relative;
				z-index: 2;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>

		<!-- Header -->
		<header>
			<div class="container header-content">
				<a href="/" class="logo">Viewport Digital <span>LLC</span></a>
				<nav>
					<a href="#flagship">Core Offer</a>
					<a href="/pricing">Tiers</a>
					<a href="/photography">Media</a>
				</nav>
				<div>
					<a href="#contact" class="btn-cinematic" style="padding: 10px 20px;">Initialize</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main>
			<!-- Hero Section -->
			<section class="hero" style="border-top: none;">
				<div class="hero-horizon"></div>
				<div class="container">
					<span class="hero-tag">[SYSTEM SECURE // CARMEL, INDIANA]</span>
					<h1>Code.<br>Capture.<br>Convert.</h1>
					<p class="hero-p">
						Unyielding web architecture and precision visual media engineered for entities that refuse to operate in the background. Zero lag. Absolute velocity.
					</p>
					<div class="hero-actions">
						<a href="#flagship" class="btn-cinematic">Execute Build</a>
						<a href="/pricing" class="btn-outline">Review Specifications</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Flagship Product Card (Tier 2 Monumental Core) -->
			<section id="flagship">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="section-header">
						<h2>The Architectural Standard.</h2>
						<p>Engineered at the intersection of raw Astro speed and edge deployment.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="monument-card">
						<div>
							<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #38bdf8;">Flagship Solution • Tier 2</span>
							<h3 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 12px 0 0 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Multi-Page Business Core</h3>
							<div class="price-display">$1,800 – $3,200</div>
							<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px;">
								Designed for professional offices and trade leaders demanding a dominant, lightning-fast digital asset that converts traffic autonomously.
							</p>
							<ul class="specs-grid">
								<li>Up to 5 custom semantic pages (Home, Services, About, Gallery, Contact)</li>
								<li>Integrated high-end commercial photography assets</li>
								<li>Instantaneous static edge hosting via Vercel</li>
								<li>Rigorously optimized SEO metadata architecture</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div style="background: rgba(3, 5, 8, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 20px;">
							<div style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: #38bdf8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">Parameters Verified</div>
							<p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;">Secure your foundational partner rate and lock in priority deployment queue status.</p>
							<a href="#contact" class="btn-cinematic" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;">Secure Build Slot</a>
							<a href="/pricing" style="text-align: center; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;" class="hover:text-white">View complete matrix &rarr;</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Commercial Media Tease -->
			<section>
				<div class="container">
					<div class="grid-2">
						<div class="cinematic-box">
							<div>
								<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #38bdf8;">Visual Domain</span>
								<h3 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 12px 0 16px 0; text-transform: uppercase;">Commercial Media Production</h3>
								<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px;">
									Eliminate standard stock imagery. We capture authentic workspace dynamics, crew operations, and precise brand textures designed for immediate component integration.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding-top: 24px;">
								<span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: #34d399;">Bundle Savings: -$150</span>
								<a href="/photography" class="btn-outline" style="padding: 8px 16px;">Access Suites</a>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="cinematic-box">
							<div>
								<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #38bdf8;">The Full Brand Suite</span>
								<div style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 12px 0 16px 0;">$750 flat</div>
								<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 32px;">
									Half-day tactical deployment. 30 to 40 fully edited, web-optimized files delivered directly to your project repository.
								</p>
							</div>
							<div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding-top: 24px;">
								<a href="/photography" style="color: #fff; font-size: 0.85rem; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-weight: 600;" class="hover:underline">Explore all packages &rarr;</a>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Ownership vs Subscription Traps -->
			<section>
				<div class="container">
					<div class="section-header">
						<h2>Total Sovereignty vs. Renting Space.</h2>
						<p>The structural divergence between custom code and mainstream subscription platforms.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="grid-2" style="gap: 40px;">
						<div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); padding: 48px;">
							<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: #ef4444; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em;">System Vulnerability</span>
							<h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 12px 0 16px 0; text-transform: uppercase;">The Subscription Trap</h3>
							<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
								Platforms like GoDaddy and Wix lock you into endless overhead for bloated templates that choke mobile performance, ruin search indexing, and leave you stranded when operational failures occur.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3); padding: 48px;">
							<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: #34d399; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em;">Absolute Control</span>
							<h3 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 12px 0 16px 0; text-transform: uppercase;">The Viewport Advantage</h3>
							<p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
								You own the code entirely. Built via Astro and Vercel for maximum execution speed and zero database bloat, backed directly by local engineering leadership in Carmel, Indiana[span_0](start_span)[span_0](end_span).
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Contact / Inquiry Section -->
			<section id="contact">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="section-header" style="text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 60px auto;">
						<h2>Initiate Transmission.</h2>
						<p>Direct contact for project deployment, media bookings, and retainer setup.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="terminal-wrap">
						<form action="https://formspree.io/f/xlgpqvaz" method="POST">
							<div class="form-group">
								<label>// Your Name</label>
								<input type="text" name="name" required placeholder="Jane Doe" />
							</div>
							<div class="form-group">
								<label>// Email Address</label>
								<input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="jane@company.com" />
							</div>
							<div class="form-group">
								<label>// Project Scope & Requirements</label>
								<textarea name="message" rows="4" required placeholder="Specify your web build tier, media suite, or deployment goals..."></textarea>
							</div>
							<button type="submit" class="btn-cinematic" style="width: 100%; padding: 18px; border: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.9rem;">
								Transmit Inquiry
							</button>
						</form>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<!-- Footer -->
		<footer>
			<div class="container">
				<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-size: 0.75rem;">&copy; 2026 Viewport Digital LLC. All rights reserved[span_1](start_span)[span_1](end_span).</p>
				<p style="font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #38bdf8;">kiimon@viewportdigitalmedia.com</p>
			</div>
		</footer>

	</body>
</html>
